    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dark shadows of your kidnapper's dungeon, you awaken to find yourself in the clutches of a deranged old man who sees you as nothing more than a doll. He has curated a sadistic game of control, where your survival depends on your ability to master his twisted version of childhood fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/76528a4040b214bdbe9ec22a3b11dd7b.poster.avif?t=1748263232\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/76528a4040b214bdbe9ec22a3b11dd7b.webm?t=1748263232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/76528a4040b214bdbe9ec22a3b11dd7b.mp4?t=1748263232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your captor has devised a series of deadly games for you to play. Each one more disturbing than the last, these challenges are designed to test your worthiness as his perfect &quot;plaything.&quot; Failure means death, and success could mean  becoming a permanent addition to his collection. Your only chance is to find a way to escape by yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/a0d9a1cf2821000429caf9a14eb3ee91.poster.avif?t=1748263232\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/a0d9a1cf2821000429caf9a14eb3ee91.webm?t=1748263232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/a0d9a1cf2821000429caf9a14eb3ee91.mp4?t=1748263232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find tools, interact with the environment and inspect items to find your way out. Each run has a different set of tools, games and means of escape. There is no safety net.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/f8b1a2b77013e5352e67f13e38d6b848.poster.avif?t=1748263232\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/f8b1a2b77013e5352e67f13e38d6b848.webm?t=1748263232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/f8b1a2b77013e5352e67f13e38d6b848.mp4?t=1748263232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each attempt you are a new victim. Don't expect the same games or means to escape. As such the game splits into two main sections - his games and your escape. If you manage to leave your room of captivity, better not get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you manage to get out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/83ee27080dbf248b3382adddad8db589.poster.avif?t=1748263232\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/83ee27080dbf248b3382adddad8db589.webm?t=1748263232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/83ee27080dbf248b3382adddad8db589.mp4?t=1748263232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 deadly &quot;Minigames&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple possible escape routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless ways to die</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed from the ground up for Keyboard+Mouse and Controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtested on PC and Steamdeck (Proton) to ensure compatibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression System (New!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full English, French and German Audio (New!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboard (New!)</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dark shadows of your kidnapper's dungeon, you awaken to find yourself in the clutches of a deranged old man who sees you as nothing more than a doll. He has curated a sadistic game of control, where your survival depends on your ability to master his twisted version of childhood fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/76528a4040b214bdbe9ec22a3b11dd7b.poster.avif?t=1748263232\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/76528a4040b214bdbe9ec22a3b11dd7b.webm?t=1748263232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/76528a4040b214bdbe9ec22a3b11dd7b.mp4?t=1748263232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your captor has devised a series of deadly games for you to play. Each one more disturbing than the last, these challenges are designed to test your worthiness as his perfect &quot;plaything.&quot; Failure means death, and success could mean  becoming a permanent addition to his collection. Your only chance is to find a way to escape by yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/a0d9a1cf2821000429caf9a14eb3ee91.poster.avif?t=1748263232\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/a0d9a1cf2821000429caf9a14eb3ee91.webm?t=1748263232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/a0d9a1cf2821000429caf9a14eb3ee91.mp4?t=1748263232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find tools, interact with the environment and inspect items to find your way out. Each run has a different set of tools, games and means of escape. There is no safety net.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/f8b1a2b77013e5352e67f13e38d6b848.poster.avif?t=1748263232\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/f8b1a2b77013e5352e67f13e38d6b848.webm?t=1748263232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/f8b1a2b77013e5352e67f13e38d6b848.mp4?t=1748263232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each attempt you are a new victim. Don't expect the same games or means to escape. As such the game splits into two main sections - his games and your escape. If you manage to leave your room of captivity, better not get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you manage to get out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/83ee27080dbf248b3382adddad8db589.poster.avif?t=1748263232\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/83ee27080dbf248b3382adddad8db589.webm?t=1748263232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/83ee27080dbf248b3382adddad8db589.mp4?t=1748263232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 deadly &quot;Minigames&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple possible escape routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless ways to die</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed from the ground up for Keyboard+Mouse and Controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtested on PC and Steamdeck (Proton) to ensure compatibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression System (New!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full English, French and German Audio (New!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboard (New!)</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You wake up in a deranged captor's dungeon, treated as a prized plaything. He subjects you to deadly games testing your worthiness\u2014failure means death, success could add you permanently to his collection. Your only chance is to escape, but beware: getting caught trying means certain doom.",
